WEBVTT

00:01.390 --> 00:05.400
Priestesses of the Godless Month

00:01.390 --> 00:03.395
Kannazuki no Miko

00:06.150 --> 00:09.069
On Chikane-chan's and my birthday...

00:09.070 --> 00:12.359
the black sunlight
that stained the sky...

00:12.360 --> 00:19.290
devoured the village, the school,
and us in a dark catastrophe.

00:19.660 --> 00:20.660
Souma!

00:38.100 --> 00:39.430
Souma.

00:39.890 --> 00:42.430
Hang in there, Souma.

01:06.290 --> 01:10.355
Haruka ni sotto yurameku urei
kattou no kioku ni ugokasare

01:10.356 --> 01:14.419
Moving the slowly unfolding, distressing
troubles from afar that were in the past

01:14.420 --> 01:17.490
mabuta ni zutto haritsuku
shiroi zekkyou ni kogoeta

01:17.491 --> 01:20.559
Strongly closing the eyelids,
the white screams have frozen

01:20.560 --> 01:22.680
- shizumu tsuki no mayoi
- The confusion of the setting moon

01:23.310 --> 01:25.080
Sonzai wa tashikani Ima koko ni

01:25.081 --> 01:26.849
Surely my existence is here now

01:26.850 --> 01:28.560
- matte iru no wa
- Waiting for me

01:28.563 --> 01:29.895
Namida nado mou nagasanai

01:29.896 --> 01:31.229
There's no more tears to cry

01:31.230 --> 01:33.360
tada dakiaeru shunkan

01:33.361 --> 01:35.490
When the moment comes when
we embrace each other

01:35.950 --> 01:38.095
ienai kikenai mienai maboroshi dake

01:38.096 --> 01:40.240
Unspoken, unheard, unseen, just an illusion

01:40.450 --> 01:42.910
toki no mukou kawa e to nagasarete

01:42.911 --> 01:45.369
Flowing towards the other side of time,

01:45.370 --> 01:47.685
mayoigo ni naru yurusenu negai

01:47.686 --> 01:50.000
becoming like a lost
child, an unforgiven wish

01:50.290 --> 01:52.480
koe dake yubi dake chikazuku ondo dake

01:52.481 --> 01:54.669
Only voice, only fingers,
only the approaching warmth

01:54.670 --> 01:58.965
todokanu omoi ga chigirarete
yokaze o someru

01:58.966 --> 02:03.260
Unspoken thoughts get tainted
by the shredded night wind

02:21.570 --> 02:23.030
Himeko...

02:25.660 --> 02:28.540
Himeko, I...

02:30.000 --> 02:33.540
I did something like that
without your consent.

02:37.130 --> 02:39.970
Himeko, I'm sorry.

02:40.640 --> 02:42.050
Himeko...

02:45.850 --> 02:48.330
Second Episode

02:48.331 --> 02:50.810
Overlapping Sun and Moon

02:48.480 --> 02:50.060
Madam...

03:03.990 --> 03:05.490
Good morning, Himeko.

03:06.490 --> 03:07.870
Chikane-chan...

03:08.200 --> 03:11.060
It's all right. It's Oogami-sensei's house.

03:11.460 --> 03:13.040
You needn't worry anymore.

03:13.540 --> 03:15.799
Anyway, how do you feel?

03:15.800 --> 03:17.589
Does it hurt anywhere?

03:17.590 --> 03:19.470
No, I'm okay.

03:19.880 --> 03:21.259
Good.

03:21.260 --> 03:22.549
I'm glad.

03:22.550 --> 03:23.550
I-I...

03:27.390 --> 03:28.979
What is it?

03:28.980 --> 03:30.440
Um...

03:31.100 --> 03:32.560
Excuse me.

03:33.520 --> 03:37.610
Oogami-sensei would like
to speak with you two.

03:44.320 --> 03:46.410
What is this?

03:47.660 --> 03:48.620
Yes.

03:48.621 --> 03:51.789
I will tell you the details the next time.

03:51.790 --> 03:55.039
Yes, take care of yourself too, Father.

03:55.040 --> 03:56.590
Goodbye.

04:01.720 --> 04:04.470
What could that have been?

04:08.260 --> 04:12.309
Chikane-chan wouldn't do
something like that to me.

04:12.310 --> 04:14.150
Was that a dream?

04:15.810 --> 04:17.150
It was a dream.

04:19.860 --> 04:21.440
Excuse me.

04:22.700 --> 04:24.820
I've escorted them.

04:25.240 --> 04:26.489
Thank you.

04:26.490 --> 04:29.659
Yukihito-kun, could you take care of Souma?

04:29.660 --> 04:31.200
Yes, Sensei.

04:34.170 --> 04:37.670
Um, did something happen to Souma-kun?

04:38.460 --> 04:40.420
He's very exhausted...

04:41.210 --> 04:43.880
so I'm having him rest
in another room now.

04:44.550 --> 04:46.890
Before that, there's your matter...

04:47.260 --> 04:51.600
No, a matter about both of
you that we must discuss.

04:51.890 --> 04:53.520
About us?

04:55.850 --> 04:59.519
What I speak of now is the
dark side of history...

04:59.520 --> 05:03.410
about the actions of inhuman
creatures from the age of gods.

05:04.110 --> 05:06.859
For you two, it will be very...

05:06.860 --> 05:09.449
Yes, very harsh...

05:09.450 --> 05:12.409
but it's a tale you cannot ever avoid.

05:12.410 --> 05:15.620
I'd like you to listen with
that in mind, all right?

05:16.420 --> 05:17.830
Yes.

05:22.630 --> 05:24.630
Please begin, Sensei.

05:25.340 --> 05:28.009
There's a single shrine on the moon.

05:28.010 --> 05:30.250
A shrine that banishes evil.

05:30.560 --> 05:32.349
A Lunar Shrine?

05:32.350 --> 05:36.770
When this shrine collapses, a
black sun will rise in the sky.

05:37.440 --> 05:42.230
And the evil god Orochi will
revive to destroy man's world.

05:44.150 --> 05:46.570
Evil god Orochi?

05:46.950 --> 05:50.740
Being a god, Orochi cannot be destroyed.

05:51.700 --> 05:55.579
Revived by the two priestesses,
only Ame no Murakumo...

05:55.580 --> 05:59.170
the great god of swordsmen,
can seal Orochi in the Lunar Shrine.

05:59.750 --> 06:00.750
The two...

06:00.810 --> 06:02.000
priestesses?

06:02.340 --> 06:03.919
A cycle of rebirth.

06:03.920 --> 06:08.360
Chaste maidens called the Solar
and Lunar Priestesses...

06:08.760 --> 06:11.530
reincarnate to serve
the god of swordsmen.

06:12.010 --> 06:17.020
Kurusugawa-kun, you have proof
of that somewhere on your body.

06:19.310 --> 06:20.650
Um...

06:21.610 --> 06:25.070
Yes. I mean... I think I do.

06:25.650 --> 06:29.989
Our family has, for generations,
as kin of the Lunar Shrine's priest...

06:29.990 --> 06:35.540
guided priestesses in reviving
Ame no Murakumo, god of swordsmen.

06:35.910 --> 06:37.619
Generations...

06:37.620 --> 06:39.670
Is Oogami Souma-san also one?

06:40.170 --> 06:41.790
Souma is...

06:43.920 --> 06:47.240
Just as Ame no Murakumo
has two priestesses...

06:47.670 --> 06:50.680
Orochi has eight followers again.

06:53.680 --> 06:55.889
Hearts embracing darkness...

06:55.890 --> 06:58.440
they bring violence to man's world.

06:59.390 --> 07:01.190
Huh?

07:01.520 --> 07:04.649
Not everyone is here, meow.

07:04.650 --> 07:06.819
One, two...

07:06.820 --> 07:08.690
A lot!

07:09.150 --> 07:11.409
Who cares.

07:11.410 --> 07:13.310
We're the bad guys, anyway.

07:13.700 --> 07:15.700
Strictness with time is, y'know...

07:18.120 --> 07:22.080
Hello, Great Mangaka-sensei.

07:24.250 --> 07:25.840
Look this way, you!

07:28.340 --> 07:30.720
Not bad, Ota-sensei.

07:31.090 --> 07:32.720
Be quiet, 69th.

07:33.470 --> 07:36.390
I-I'm 68th!

07:37.180 --> 07:38.559
What is?

07:38.560 --> 07:40.850
What's 68th, meow?

07:42.060 --> 07:44.810
Her highest CD sales rank.

07:46.230 --> 07:48.399
Shut up! Get over there!

07:48.400 --> 07:51.859
Korocchi is scary, meow!

07:51.860 --> 07:54.620
What would an amateur know?

07:56.120 --> 07:59.390
Still, the Seventh Neck
isn't here, naturally.

07:59.790 --> 08:03.289
The Eighth Neck is doing
the usual hide-and-seek.

08:03.290 --> 08:07.750
And that Third Neck guy...
Where'd that dumb muscle-head go?

08:08.300 --> 08:09.760
Girochi.

08:11.470 --> 08:14.830
He couldn't wait and went
to kill the priestesses.

08:15.260 --> 08:19.219
Really, he's always so brash.
What a hopeless little brother.

08:19.220 --> 08:21.140
But, but why'd the Seventh
Neck betray us, meow?

08:23.890 --> 08:25.519
I don't know.

08:25.520 --> 08:29.750
Basically, he shouldn't be able
to resist the Orochi gene.

08:33.400 --> 08:37.159
Perhaps it's due to the priestesses' power?

08:37.160 --> 08:42.660
Or is it some strong
willpower that drives him?

08:43.830 --> 08:44.830
Meow?

08:53.340 --> 08:57.259
Souma is not part of the Oogami family.

08:57.260 --> 09:00.600
He was adopted by our family as a child.

09:01.140 --> 09:05.640
Souma is your enemy. A
member of the Orochi.

09:07.100 --> 09:08.479
No way...

09:08.480 --> 09:12.939
The giant you saw... That's
one of Orochi's eight bodies.

09:12.940 --> 09:14.650
No!

09:14.950 --> 09:17.020
Kurusugawa-san!

09:19.950 --> 09:21.199
I'm sorry.

09:21.200 --> 09:23.749
I seem to have rushed through the story.

09:23.750 --> 09:26.460
No, it had to be known at some point.

09:26.960 --> 09:30.380
And I think a decision must be made.

09:31.090 --> 09:32.629
I'm truly sorry.

09:32.630 --> 09:33.670
Um, Sensei...

09:34.010 --> 09:36.430
Is he... Is Oogami-san really...

09:37.640 --> 09:40.930
No, it's fine. Your concern
is understandable.

09:41.680 --> 09:45.559
Because Souma is one of the
Orochi and after your lives...

09:45.560 --> 09:48.480
it's natural to think of the prospect.

09:49.020 --> 09:50.930
I still can't believe it.

09:51.360 --> 09:52.940
I'm one of the Orochi?

09:53.610 --> 09:55.950
I tried to kill Kurusugawa.

09:56.200 --> 09:57.200
I...

09:57.450 --> 09:58.819
With these hands, I...

09:58.820 --> 10:03.579
I feel it. Something deep
in my soul is roaring.

10:03.580 --> 10:05.330
The Orochi in me shouts...

10:05.620 --> 10:06.830
to kill the priestesses.

10:07.710 --> 10:08.830
Even now.

10:09.290 --> 10:11.419
Nii-san, I...

10:11.420 --> 10:13.799
If this was going to happen, I...

10:13.800 --> 10:14.879
Enough.

10:14.880 --> 10:15.880
Nii-san...

10:16.470 --> 10:17.799
Listen, Souma.

10:17.800 --> 10:20.850
If not for you, the Orochi
would've killed them.

10:21.090 --> 10:22.810
You protected them.

10:23.930 --> 10:25.430
Nii-san...

10:26.020 --> 10:28.900
I just want you to
understand this one thing.

10:29.350 --> 10:33.860
The one suffering the most
from this is Souma himself.

10:34.570 --> 10:36.399
I believe in him.

10:36.400 --> 10:41.200
Souma isn't the kind of man who'd
lose to the Orochi within him.

10:42.280 --> 10:43.280
I understand.

10:43.870 --> 10:46.370
I'll leave it to you, Sensei.

10:47.250 --> 10:51.000
And there's one more thing I must tell you.

10:51.830 --> 10:55.839
It's about what a priestess
is and also about you.

10:55.840 --> 10:56.840
Me?

11:00.630 --> 11:02.180
Chikane-chan?

11:02.510 --> 11:03.550
Sensei?

11:05.740 --> 11:06.740
Himeko!

11:14.980 --> 11:15.980
It's strong...

11:16.980 --> 11:19.950
My very own Gungal is strong!

11:24.950 --> 11:27.370
Megaton Knuckle!

11:48.180 --> 11:49.890
Kurusugawa-san.

11:52.100 --> 11:54.440
Sensei, where's Mako-chan?

11:57.520 --> 12:02.109
Saotome-san? Probably at
Kamiyatate University Medical.

12:02.110 --> 12:03.950
Most of the injured were taken there.

12:02.950 --> 12:04.950
Makoto

12:03.951 --> 12:04.950
Saotome

12:18.700 --> 12:19.880
Himeko.

12:20.760 --> 12:22.080
Mako-chan...

12:24.560 --> 12:25.639
What the...

12:25.640 --> 12:27.100
Sensei!

12:28.180 --> 12:29.769
So you're safe.

12:29.770 --> 12:31.179
Y-Yeah.

12:31.180 --> 12:32.180
I see.

12:32.181 --> 12:34.020
I was worried...

12:34.850 --> 12:38.770
that you might have screwed up like me.

12:40.230 --> 12:42.900
I'm really glad, really glad.

12:43.700 --> 12:46.069
Mako-chan, your leg...

12:46.070 --> 12:48.659
Oh, this is nothing.

12:48.660 --> 12:50.910
B-But, Mako-chan... But...

12:51.330 --> 12:53.749
It's okay. Don't worry about it.

12:53.750 --> 12:55.459
But the Inter-high tournament...

12:55.460 --> 12:56.460
It's okay.

12:57.290 --> 12:58.920
Anyway, look at this, Himeko.

12:59.500 --> 13:01.759
Miya-sama sent a get-well gift.

13:01.760 --> 13:03.920
Isn't it great? I was so touched.

13:04.430 --> 13:08.509
I'm unexpectedly a VIP.
Jeez, what a surprise.

13:08.510 --> 13:12.059
Or so I thought, but I wasn't the only one.

13:12.060 --> 13:13.960
I guess that makes sense.

13:16.270 --> 13:17.860
Mako-chan...

13:21.360 --> 13:22.780
Himeko.

13:23.320 --> 13:24.320
Sorry...

13:24.950 --> 13:25.950
Could you leave?

13:26.280 --> 13:27.819
Mako-chan, I...

13:27.820 --> 13:28.820
Sorry.

13:29.030 --> 13:30.080
Leave.

14:03.190 --> 14:04.530
It's my fault.

14:04.900 --> 14:07.109
I was asked to care for her...

14:07.110 --> 14:09.030
I'm very sorry.

14:13.370 --> 14:14.370
Himeko!

14:14.660 --> 14:18.539
I was picked as the next
Inter-high's prefecture rep!

14:18.540 --> 14:21.709
Way to go, Mako-chan! A
freshman, that's amazing!

14:21.710 --> 14:23.459
Mako-chan, you're amazing!

14:23.460 --> 14:25.960
I'll do my best, okay?

14:28.930 --> 14:30.260
Mako-chan...

14:31.100 --> 14:33.009
What should I do?

14:33.010 --> 14:34.349
It's...

14:34.350 --> 14:36.180
It's my fault.

14:42.770 --> 14:46.280
Ame no Ho Station

14:49.150 --> 14:52.370
I wonder how Chikane-chan is doing.

14:53.740 --> 14:55.789
I can't. I can't.

14:55.790 --> 14:58.670
I know I couldn't bear it if I saw her.

14:59.160 --> 15:01.790
I'll be all alone from now on.

15:02.840 --> 15:05.840
I have to go far away alone.

15:10.340 --> 15:12.009
Chikane-chan...

15:12.010 --> 15:13.800
Aren't you hungry?

15:17.600 --> 15:19.139
I'm starving.

15:19.140 --> 15:20.519
I knew it.

15:20.520 --> 15:22.150
You knew it.

15:25.570 --> 15:27.150
If I'm here...

15:27.780 --> 15:30.399
I'll cause trouble for others.

15:30.400 --> 15:33.529
So I thought I shouldn't
stay in the village.

15:33.530 --> 15:34.699
I see.

15:34.700 --> 15:37.910
Then I should go with you, too.

15:39.620 --> 15:42.420
I don't mind deep woods
or uninhabited islands.

15:43.000 --> 15:46.669
Let's see... Let's have Otoha-san
prepare what we'll need.

15:46.670 --> 15:48.130
You can't do that!

15:48.630 --> 15:50.170
You don't want to go with me?

15:50.590 --> 15:53.180
No, that's not what I mean.

15:53.510 --> 15:55.640
You and I are different.

15:55.970 --> 15:57.559
You're...

15:57.560 --> 16:02.599
If you leave, then everyone will be so sad.

16:02.600 --> 16:04.940
You're different from me, so...

16:05.690 --> 16:07.569
If you leave...

16:07.570 --> 16:08.900
I'll be sad.

16:10.110 --> 16:11.110
Besides...

16:21.210 --> 16:23.709
That's the L-Lunar...

16:23.710 --> 16:25.830
Yes, the Lunar Priestess' symbol.

16:26.290 --> 16:29.710
I'm a priestess just like you.

16:30.460 --> 16:33.929
You're the Lunar Priestess?

16:33.930 --> 16:35.720
You see, Himeko...

16:36.090 --> 16:39.720
I'll never stop you from
doing what you want.

16:40.120 --> 16:44.440
But do you really want to
go off somewhere alone?

16:45.230 --> 16:46.440
I...

16:50.280 --> 16:53.399
I have a friend named Mako-chan.

16:53.400 --> 16:57.699
She's energetic, cheerful,
and always kind to me.

16:57.700 --> 16:59.829
She's busy with morning practice...

16:59.830 --> 17:02.619
but she's always there for me.

17:02.620 --> 17:04.460
When I apologize...

17:04.750 --> 17:06.959
she says, "We're roommates..."

17:06.960 --> 17:09.960
and runs at night to make up for it.

17:10.750 --> 17:12.589
Yet I...

17:12.590 --> 17:14.169
Because of me...

17:14.170 --> 17:16.970
No, it's not your fault.

17:18.220 --> 17:20.559
But, Chikane-chan...

17:20.560 --> 17:22.469
It's not your fault.

17:22.470 --> 17:24.519
Being born a priestess...

17:24.520 --> 17:28.519
Being reincarnated as
priestesses isn't our fault.

17:28.520 --> 17:32.990
I can't forgive the fact that you
have to cry over a fate like that.

17:33.690 --> 17:36.740
That's why I want to fight with you.

17:37.240 --> 17:38.700
I want to protect you.

17:39.740 --> 17:43.409
We still have things we can do here.

17:43.410 --> 17:44.410
Chikane-chan...

17:45.660 --> 17:47.869
Found you, priestesses.

17:47.870 --> 17:48.870
Who are you?

17:49.920 --> 17:52.920
Orochi's Third Neck, Girochi.

18:03.720 --> 18:05.270
You're so cute...

18:05.600 --> 18:08.059
I'm falling for you, Solar Priestess.

18:08.060 --> 18:09.599
Love on first sight!

18:09.600 --> 18:13.280
Hey, Himeko, or should I say Hime-chan?

18:14.650 --> 18:16.069
That's it!

18:16.070 --> 18:17.280
It's Hime-chan.

18:17.570 --> 18:21.280
Hey, let's go on a date, a date.

18:22.780 --> 18:23.790
Stay back.

18:24.160 --> 18:25.160
Huh?

18:25.400 --> 18:27.160
Stay back, you vulgar creature!

18:27.500 --> 18:30.880
I'll pass on the Lunar Priestess.
Your boobs are too big, gross!

18:33.710 --> 18:35.300
Chikane-chan!

18:37.130 --> 18:38.679
Oh, soft.

18:38.680 --> 18:40.929
No! Let me go! Chikane-chan!

18:40.930 --> 18:42.180
A nice voice, too.

18:42.550 --> 18:45.180
So let's go on a date.

18:45.680 --> 18:47.350
That hurt.

18:48.230 --> 18:49.230
Chikane-chan!

18:49.520 --> 18:51.690
What do you think you're doing?

18:53.820 --> 18:55.690
That hurt, you bitch!

18:57.450 --> 18:58.450
Chikane-chan!

19:04.080 --> 19:06.579
Damn, I said I'd pass.

19:06.580 --> 19:09.080
That's why I hate big-boobed girls.

19:11.300 --> 19:13.129
What's with that look?

19:13.130 --> 19:15.050
You're the one losing.

19:15.310 --> 19:17.550
Stop it! Please stop!

19:17.880 --> 19:21.510
Apologize. Get on your knees
and say, "I'm sorry."

19:21.800 --> 19:22.800
No!

19:28.140 --> 19:29.140
Oogami-kun!

19:29.850 --> 19:31.060
Don't go, Himeko!

19:32.600 --> 19:34.109
I'll fight.

19:34.110 --> 19:37.609
I'll be sure to protect the world
you live in. To protect you!

19:37.610 --> 19:40.110
So don't go anywhere!

19:43.950 --> 19:46.120
You're the Seventh Neck, huh?

19:46.700 --> 19:51.870
Don't you confess your feelings
to my Hime-chan, you bastard!

19:52.590 --> 19:56.340
Come on, Girochi's very own Gungal!

20:00.090 --> 20:02.840
It's revenge time!

20:10.320 --> 20:11.320
What?

20:18.020 --> 20:19.480
Come on, Orochi!

20:19.780 --> 20:21.700
What was that?

20:30.160 --> 20:31.829
Interesting.

20:31.830 --> 20:34.039
This is entertainment.

20:34.040 --> 20:37.290
Take this! Megaton Knuckle 2!

20:46.090 --> 20:49.099
Hey, what's wrong, Seventh Neck?

20:49.100 --> 20:52.100
How did that skill beat my sister?

21:01.110 --> 21:02.779
Damn you...

21:02.780 --> 21:05.240
Megaton Knuckle 3!

21:08.980 --> 21:10.700
W-What's this?

21:16.790 --> 21:18.589
Take this.

21:18.590 --> 21:22.260
Sparkling Solar Wave of
Ultimate Destruction!

21:22.590 --> 21:23.880
S-Shit...

21:26.720 --> 21:28.890
Blast into pieces!

21:35.440 --> 21:37.519
Himeko. Himeko.

21:37.520 --> 21:40.230
Are you all right, Himeko?

21:41.440 --> 21:45.319
Chikane-chan, I want to stay here.

21:45.320 --> 21:49.489
I want to be with you. I
want to be with Oogami-kun.

21:49.490 --> 21:52.240
I want to stay here with everyone!

22:10.470 --> 22:12.010
- Itsuka mita yume
- A dream that was once saw

22:12.013 --> 22:14.020
- Todokanai tsubuyaki dake
- Just a murmur that does not get through

22:14.023 --> 22:15.830
Yoru no hikari ni tsutsumarete samayoi yuku

22:15.831 --> 22:17.639
Wandering while wrapped up in night's light

22:17.640 --> 22:21.230
- Yagate mihiraku sono hitomi Unmei nara - If it
is fate, those eyes will be opened before long

22:21.233 --> 22:22.755
Semete Sou ima dake

22:22.756 --> 22:24.279
At least... yes, only now

22:24.280 --> 22:26.650
- Kanawanai to utsumuku - Looking
downward as the wish does not come true

22:26.653 --> 22:28.660
- Yokaze ni tada unadare
- Merely hanging my head in the night wind

22:28.663 --> 22:32.330
- Namida Tsukikage Te no hira ni afurete yuku - Tears
and moonlight continue to overflow from my palm

22:32.333 --> 22:33.910
- Nani ga hoshii no
- What do you want?

22:33.913 --> 22:36.120
Kuchibiru wa yami ni furuete ita

22:36.121 --> 22:38.329
My lips shivered in the darkness

22:38.330 --> 22:40.665
Deatta ano toki ni mune tsuita egao

22:40.666 --> 22:42.999
The smiling face that pierced
my chest when we came across

22:43.000 --> 22:45.940
Mamoritakute Zutto kuzuresou na yakusoku o

22:45.941 --> 22:48.879
I want to protect it, the promise
that always looks about to collapse

22:48.880 --> 22:50.925
Itami tsubusu hodo ni dakishimeteta

22:50.926 --> 22:52.970
I embraced it while crushing the pain

22:53.810 --> 22:55.225
Soba ni ireru dake de

22:55.226 --> 22:56.639
Just by being by my side

22:56.640 --> 22:58.455
Onaji jikan ni irareru dake de

22:58.456 --> 23:00.269
Just by remaining in the same time as me

23:00.270 --> 23:03.730
Tooi kioku Yomigaeru kanashimi
mo atatamete yukeru no ni

23:03.731 --> 23:07.189
The distant memory and
revived sadness can warmed

23:07.190 --> 23:09.175
Mawaritsuzukete iru omoi ni

23:09.176 --> 23:11.159
In the feelings that continue to circulate

23:11.160 --> 23:12.970
Yasuragi michita owari wa kuru no

23:12.971 --> 23:14.779
Will a peaceful ending come?

23:14.780 --> 23:16.595
Kurikaeshita toikake wa ten ni mai

23:16.596 --> 23:18.409
The repeated question dance in heavens

23:18.410 --> 23:23.940
Ake no sora no Hikari ni kawaru

23:23.941 --> 23:29.470
And turns into the light of the morning sky

23:40.390 --> 23:41.519
Next Time

23:41.520 --> 23:45.110
This is how my new life started.

23:45.650 --> 23:50.360
The wave of destiny sways
me back and forth.

23:50.950 --> 23:55.130
Yet I still believed that I'd be fine.

23:55.450 --> 23:58.080
Because I'm with Chikane-chan.

23:58.450 --> 23:59.410
But...

23:59.420 --> 24:06.420
Secret Love Shell

23:59.870 --> 24:00.880
But...

24:01.250 --> 24:04.829
Next time on Kannazuki no Miko, episode 3.

24:04.830 --> 24:06.119
Secret Love Shell

24:06.120 --> 24:10.139
Chikane-chan, what am I supposed to do?
